# --- Runway Project (proxied from a separate Netlify deploy) ---
# After you deploy runway/ to its own Netlify site, replace
# RUNWAY_NETLIFY_HOSTNAME below with that site's *.netlify.app hostname
# (Netlify dashboard → Site settings → Domain management → Default subdomain).
# Status 200 = silent proxy; the URL bar stays as bhaglabs.com/runway.
/runway        https://RUNWAY_NETLIFY_HOSTNAME.netlify.app/runway        200
/runway/*      https://RUNWAY_NETLIFY_HOSTNAME.netlify.app/runway/:splat  200

# SPA fallback for the landing page itself.
/*             /index.html                                                200
